    "measured (L0)": "lock times, beat rates, coherence and the end-of-run hold test are computed from the phases the audio is synthesised from; the lock condition and slip rate are Adler's.",
    "perceptual models (L1)": "sensory dissonance (Plomp & Levelt 1965; Sethares 1993) and the fluctuation weighting (Zwicker & Fastl: strongest near 4 Hz) are models of perception, used as proxies; neither was fitted to a listener here.",
